{"unit": "ppra-20usc1232h#u000", "extractor": {"provider": "claude_cli", "model_role": "extractor", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "prompt_sha256": "88d391e96dea0074992c53b07f58387a33e927653764392d8a0b52f43978571b", "prompt_version": "extract_v1"}, "status": "grounded", "item": "obligation", "text": "All instructional materials, including teacher's manuals, films, tapes, or other supplementary material which will be used in connection with any survey, analysis, or evaluation as part of any applicable program shall be available for inspection by the parents or guardians of the children.", "span": {"start": 477, "end": 767, "sha256": "dba94a73e0964eb240ebfe425b775b350fa2947820965901fcdb750a31080124", "parsed_sha256": "9574099a0139d904395ae25bf051ae483580070962ff726e98cf2d8755408ed7"}, "matches_in_unit": 1, "section_path": "§1232h. Protection of pupil rights > (a) Inspection of instructional materials by parents or guardians", "page": null, "force": "obligation", "binds": null, "responsible_party_stated": false, "mechanism_stated": null}
{"unit": "ppra-20usc1232h#u000", "extractor": {"provider": "claude_cli", "model_role": "extractor", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "prompt_sha256": "88d391e96dea0074992c53b07f58387a33e927653764392d8a0b52f43978571b", "prompt_version": "extract_v1"}, "status": "grounded", "item": "obligation", "text": "No student shall be required, as part of any applicable program, to submit to a survey, analysis, or evaluation that reveals information concerning-", "span": {"start": 822, "end": 970, "sha256": "776952842da85d132d7b255ae7de332864c36bf31921a3efc732cc65712b7096", "parsed_sha256": "9574099a0139d904395ae25bf051ae483580070962ff726e98cf2d8755408ed7"}, "matches_in_unit": 1, "section_path": "§1232h. Protection of pupil rights > (b) Limits on survey, analysis, or evaluations", "page": null, "force": "prohibition", "binds": null, "responsible_party_stated": false, "mechanism_stated": "without the prior written consent of the parent"}
{"unit": "ppra-20usc1232h#u000", "extractor": {"provider": "claude_cli", "model_role": "extractor", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "prompt_sha256": "88d391e96dea0074992c53b07f58387a33e927653764392d8a0b52f43978571b", "prompt_version": "extract_v1"}, "status": "grounded", "item": "obligation", "text": "Except as provided in subsections (a) and (b), a local educational agency that receives funds under any applicable program shall develop and adopt policies, in consultation with parents, regarding the following:", "span": {"start": 2097, "end": 2308, "sha256": "028804787bb1dad2303fcfd22501c619b1540a57db778a38803b4d303cf5a5ea", "parsed_sha256": "9574099a0139d904395ae25bf051ae483580070962ff726e98cf2d8755408ed7"}, "matches_in_unit": 1, "section_path": "§1232h. Protection of pupil rights > (1) Development and adoption of local policies", "page": null, "force": "obligation", "binds": "a local educational agency that receives funds under any applicable program", "responsible_party_stated": true, "mechanism_stated": "in consultation with parents"}
{"unit": "ppra-20usc1232h#u001", "extractor": {"provider": "claude_cli", "model_role": "extractor", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "prompt_sha256": "40db36b5167f58bffc34b31b8b80a8d3c4ee34797a07baf7ebb484f66457ed82", "prompt_version": "extract_v1"}, "status": "grounded", "item": "obligation", "text": "The policies developed by a local educational agency under paragraph (1) shall provide for reasonable notice of the adoption or continued use of such policies directly to the parents of students enrolled in schools served by that agency.", "span": {"start": 5072, "end": 5309, "sha256": "fe94b80c3b3d809b97bfe91db3d305372edbb59a9da15fd240b05b82e764a7b1", "parsed_sha256": "9574099a0139d904395ae25bf051ae483580070962ff726e98cf2d8755408ed7"}, "matches_in_unit": 1, "section_path": "§1232h. Protection of pupil rights > (A) Notification of policies", "page": null, "force": "obligation", "binds": "The policies developed by a local educational agency", "responsible_party_stated": true, "mechanism_stated": "reasonable notice of the adoption or continued use of such policies directly to the parents"}
{"unit": "ppra-20usc1232h#u001", "extractor": {"provider": "claude_cli", "model_role": "extractor", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "prompt_sha256": "40db36b5167f58bffc34b31b8b80a8d3c4ee34797a07baf7ebb484f66457ed82", "prompt_version": "extract_v1"}, "status": "grounded", "item": "obligation", "text": "At a minimum, the agency shall-\n\n(i) provide such notice at least annually, at the beginning of the school year, and within a reasonable period of time after any substantive change in such policies;", "span": {"start": 5310, "end": 5508, "sha256": "bd9e3130bf19de1a32d1e1cd02b522b30b2d5a498e9e2878c4ab247b4e9f1370", "parsed_sha256": "9574099a0139d904395ae25bf051ae483580070962ff726e98cf2d8755408ed7"}, "matches_in_unit": 1, "section_path": "§1232h. Protection of pupil rights > (A) Notification of policies", "page": null, "force": "obligation", "binds": "the agency", "responsible_party_stated": true, "mechanism_stated": "at least annually, at the beginning of the school year, and within a reasonable period of time after any substantive change in such policies"}
{"unit": "ppra-20usc1232h#u001", "extractor": {"provider": "claude_cli", "model_role": "extractor", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "prompt_sha256": "40db36b5167f58bffc34b31b8b80a8d3c4ee34797a07baf7ebb484f66457ed82", "prompt_version": "extract_v1"}, "status": "ungrounded", "why": "text_not_in_passage", "item": "obligation", "text_claimed": "At a minimum, the agency shall- (ii) offer an opportunity for the parent (and for purposes of an activity described in subparagraph (C)(i), in the case of a student of an appropriate age, the student) to opt the student out of participation in an activity described in subparagraph (C)."}
{"unit": "ppra-20usc1232h#u001", "extractor": {"provider": "claude_cli", "model_role": "extractor", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "prompt_sha256": "40db36b5167f58bffc34b31b8b80a8d3c4ee34797a07baf7ebb484f66457ed82", "prompt_version": "extract_v1"}, "status": "grounded", "item": "obligation", "text": "The local educational agency shall directly notify the parent of a student, at least annually at the beginning of the school year, of the specific or approximate dates during the school year when activities described in subparagraph (C) are scheduled, or expected to be scheduled.", "span": {"start": 5812, "end": 6092, "sha256": "39d25661ab9669af00bfdcaee74de60fba3d1894800c895f30749b044ee4d93a", "parsed_sha256": "9574099a0139d904395ae25bf051ae483580070962ff726e98cf2d8755408ed7"}, "matches_in_unit": 1, "section_path": "§1232h. Protection of pupil rights > (B) Notification of specific events", "page": null, "force": "obligation", "binds": "The local educational agency", "responsible_party_stated": true, "mechanism_stated": "at least annually at the beginning of the school year"}
{"unit": "ppra-20usc1232h#u001", "extractor": {"provider": "claude_cli", "model_role": "extractor", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "prompt_sha256": "40db36b5167f58bffc34b31b8b80a8d3c4ee34797a07baf7ebb484f66457ed82", "prompt_version": "extract_v1"}, "status": "grounded", "item": "obligation", "text": "A local educational agency need not develop and adopt new policies if the State educational agency or local educational agency has in place, on January 8, 2002, policies covering the requirements of paragraph (1).", "span": {"start": 6904, "end": 7117, "sha256": "3f70fd7b52663db971c0ffdde695bf25f749b5fd1c8b6472caba1de3bb882011", "parsed_sha256": "9574099a0139d904395ae25bf051ae483580070962ff726e98cf2d8755408ed7"}, "matches_in_unit": 1, "section_path": "§1232h. Protection of pupil rights > (3) Existing policies", "page": null, "force": "permission", "binds": "A local educational agency", "responsible_party_stated": true, "mechanism_stated": "if the State educational agency or local educational agency has in place, on January 8, 2002, policies covering the requirements of paragraph (1)"}
{"unit": "ppra-20usc1232h#u001", "extractor": {"provider": "claude_cli", "model_role": "extractor", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "prompt_sha256": "40db36b5167f58bffc34b31b8b80a8d3c4ee34797a07baf7ebb484f66457ed82", "prompt_version": "extract_v1"}, "status": "grounded", "item": "obligation", "text": "The agency shall provide reasonable notice of such existing policies to parents and guardians of students, in accordance with paragraph (2).", "span": {"start": 7118, "end": 7258, "sha256": "282c69304dace5917ca0a9db8011648c930d588c758e5c77da8f9b85219e4a66", "parsed_sha256": "9574099a0139d904395ae25bf051ae483580070962ff726e98cf2d8755408ed7"}, "matches_in_unit": 1, "section_path": "§1232h. Protection of pupil rights > (3) Existing policies", "page": null, "force": "obligation", "binds": "The agency", "responsible_party_stated": true, "mechanism_stated": "in accordance with paragraph (2)"}
{"unit": "ppra-20usc1232h#u001", "extractor": {"provider": "claude_cli", "model_role": "extractor", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "prompt_sha256": "40db36b5167f58bffc34b31b8b80a8d3c4ee34797a07baf7ebb484f66457ed82", "prompt_version": "extract_v1"}, "status": "grounded", "item": "obligation", "text": "Paragraph (1)(E) does not apply to the collection, disclosure, or use of personal information collected from students for the exclusive purpose of developing, evaluating, or providing educational products or services for, or to, students or educational institutions, such as the following:", "span": {"start": 7324, "end": 7613, "sha256": "87afc9730f928d7df87643dd2b5d615fa64db22d2446548352d9500499a327f8", "parsed_sha256": "9574099a0139d904395ae25bf051ae483580070962ff726e98cf2d8755408ed7"}, "matches_in_unit": 1, "section_path": "§1232h. Protection of pupil rights > (A) Educational products or services", "page": null, "force": "permission", "binds": null, "responsible_party_stated": false, "mechanism_stated": "for the exclusive purpose of developing, evaluating, or providing educational products or services for, or to, students or educational institutions"}
{"unit": "ppra-20usc1232h#u001", "extractor": {"provider": "claude_cli", "model_role": "extractor", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "prompt_sha256": "40db36b5167f58bffc34b31b8b80a8d3c4ee34797a07baf7ebb484f66457ed82", "prompt_version": "extract_v1"}, "status": "grounded", "item": "definition", "text": "The following activities require notification under this paragraph:", "span": {"start": 6138, "end": 6205, "sha256": "64d28b8664eaf78e513d84c434a7f7c33cf821e018e1cc54c82f83b17749bbb8", "parsed_sha256": "9574099a0139d904395ae25bf051ae483580070962ff726e98cf2d8755408ed7"}, "matches_in_unit": 1, "section_path": "§1232h. Protection of pupil rights > (C) Activities requiring notification", "page": null, "term": "Activities requiring notification"}
